# Observability audit trail (issue #177) — append-only, local only
.planning/.ferrox-trace.jsonl

# Coordination + halting runtime state (Phase-4 cross-audit Fix 5) — local only,
# written by real/dogfood runs; must never pollute the Phase-8 merge.
.planning/halting-log.jsonl
.planning/coord/
.planning/rescope-state.json

# STATE.md rebuild audit trail (phase 14.1 D3d): append-only, local run evidence,
# same class as the trace log and the halting log above. It lives OUTSIDE the file
# it audits so a versionless claim a rebuild deletes cannot survive inside it.
.planning/state-rebuild-log.jsonl
.ferrox/state-rebuild-log.jsonl

# Anti-loop event log (phase 15 D6): append-only local run evidence, the same class
# as the halting log and the state rebuild log above. Every review budget and every
# round counter is derived by folding it, so it is run state and never a commit.
.planning/antiloop-log.jsonl
.ferrox/antiloop-log.jsonl

# Visual companion runtime state (pid, log, events; per-session, never committed).
# The committed brainstorm record is BRAINSTORM.md + research/ + screens/ only.
.planning/brainstorms/*/state/
.planning/human-sla-park.json

# Mutation testing artifacts (issue #454)
.stryker-tmp/
.stryker-incremental.json
reports/mutation/

# Local Crabbox machine configuration
.crabbox.yaml
.crabbox.local.yaml

# Memtrace local daemon/runtime state (per-machine; never committed)
.memdb/
.memtrace/

# Offer-layer local state. Per-project and per-machine: which offers have been
# shown or answered, and the decision log the acceptance/miss counters fold. It
# describes one person's sessions, so committing it would carry one machine's
# suppression state to everybody who clones.
.planning/.ferrox-offers.json
.planning/.ferrox-offers.jsonl
